        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Standard Duty Residential and Commercial Deadbolts</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFit standard 2-1/8\" pre drilled doors. \r\n<br>Adjustable backset deadbolt for easy installation on wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable as <B>Single Cylinder</b> (Keyed lock on the outside with thumbturn inside) or <B>Double Cylinder</b> (Keyed lock on both outside and inside).\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>U.L., U.L.C. Listed, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, UL10B Neutral Pressure Rated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PDQ Standard Duty Satin Stainless Steel Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 2-1/8\" door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" throw with case-hardened roller pin. Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 2-3/4\" x 1-1/8\". Brass or stainless steel.</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Trim: Stainless steel.</li> -->\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 5-pins.</li>\r\n<li><b>630 - Satin Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder (ANSI E2152): Keyed lock cylinder on the outside with thumbturn inside</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder (ANSI E2142): Keyed lock cylinder on both outside and inside</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
